OL,3,APrince William and Catherine's surprise
OL,4,Avisit to Kevin Sinfield's charity run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales made a
OL,7,Fsurprise visit to support rugby league
OL,8,Fstar Sir Kevin Sinfield, on the third
OL,9,Fday of his endurance challenge to raise
OL,10,Ffunds for Motor Neurone Disease (MND)
OL,11,Fcharities.
OL,13,F"What you're doing is so inspiring `
OL,14,Fthe unity that you're building,"
OL,15,FCatherine told Sir Kevin.
OL,17,FPrince William and Catherine caught up
OL,18,Fwith Sir Kevin in Wakefield, West
OL,19,FYorkshire, as he carries out what he
OL,20,Fsays will be his final fundraising
OL,21,Fchallenge.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
